//! Frozen exact cell averages for surveyed endpoint propagation.
//!
//! Three bands, g = 1, 20 m, at rest 1.5 m, left-end policy, t = 2 s. The exact solution
//! is the self-similar boundary Riemann solution. Cell `j` covers `[j dx, (j + 1) dx]`
//! with `dx` the binary64 `20 / N`. Each cell holds directed bounds of the averages
//! `[area lower, area upper, discharge lower, discharge upper, depth lower, depth upper]`.
//! Depth is the depth of the mean area. The right-end case reverses cell order and
//! negates discharge.

